      "candidate_urls_count": 1,
      "content": "Provide understanding of toxicology related to the environment; furthermore provide an insight into the impacts of hazardous substances in the environment to the individual or the public. Promote the development of a comprehensive and systematic knowledge of this field with depth, specialisation and up-to-date knowledge. Develop effective information retrieval and processing skills and the ability to critically engage with current research and scholarship in toxicology.",
